WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.650
smart pot. Animated system walkthrough of the documented flow. Drawn from the 2023 repository code. Sample readings, no hardware footage. The repo has no app screen.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.750
Three sensor boards, each on its own NodeMCU

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Temperature and humidity go to the API as JSON over Wi-Fi

4
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.600
Soil moisture is mapped to a percentage on the board, then posted

5
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.800
The light sensor only prints to serial: no upload code in the repo

6
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.450
The API stores each reading and returns a running average

7
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.800
The real API, running locally with sample readings

8
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:18.100
Soil moisture rows from the second board, same pattern

9
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.800
smart pot. Walkthrough of the code plus its real API running locally. Readings are samples.

